    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60534" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠβό-κῠβος</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cube multiplied by
			cube</i>, i.e. <i>sixth power</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hippol.
				<u>Haer.</u>
				1.2.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sixth power of unknown quantity, x</i><i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dioph.
				1
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Def.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.131
			</span></i> P.:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠβοκῠβοστόν</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόριον</span>), τό, <i>fraction
				corresponding to</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυβόκυβος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>/<i>x</i><i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dioph.
				1
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Def.</u>
				3
			</span></i>.</div>
